<main id="main">
<section class="sub-hero"><div class="sub-hero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/documents.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/documents-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/documents.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="601" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.1"></div><div class="shell sub-hero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span><a href="/utah-claim-calculators/">Calculators</a><span class="sep">›</span><span aria-current="page">RCV to ACV Holdback Calculator</span></nav><p class="kicker">Free calculator · runs in your browser</p><h1>RCV to ACV Holdback Calculator</h1><p class="lede">Replacement cost policies usually pay in two installments: actual cash value first, then the depreciation held back once repairs are finished. Add your items to see how the money splits.</p></div></section><section class="sec tool-sec"><div class="shell"><div class="rv">
<div class="tool tool-wide" data-tool="dep">
  <div class="tool-head"><span>RCV to ACV holdback calculator</span><i>Add as many items as you need</i></div>
  <div class="tool-body">
    <div class="tool-in">
      <div class="table-wrap items-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Replacement cost ($)</th><th>Age (yrs)</th><th>Life (yrs)</th><th>ACV</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>
      <tr><td><input name="item" value="Laminated shingle roof" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="21400" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="11" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="30" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Basement carpet & pad" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="3100" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="5" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="10" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr><tr><td><input name="item" value="Drywall paint — main floor" aria-label="Item"></td><td><input name="rcv" inputmode="decimal" value="2650" aria-label="Replacement cost"></td><td><input name="age" inputmode="decimal" value="3" aria-label="Age in years"></td><td><input name="life" inputmode="decimal" value="10" aria-label="Expected life in years"></td><td class="mono" data-o="row">$0</td><td><button type="button" class="x" aria-label="Remove row">×</button></td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn ghost small" data-add data-run>+ Add item</button></div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div><label for="d-ded">Deductible ($)</label><input id="d-ded" name="deduct" inputmode="decimal" value="1000"></div>
        <div><label for="d-cap">Maximum depreciation</label><select id="d-cap" name="cap"><option value="50">50%</option><option value="70">70%</option><option value="80" selected>80%</option><option value="90">90%</option></select><span class="hint">Most estimates cap depreciation; check yours.</span></div>
      </div>
      <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="nonrec"> My policy pays actual cash value only (no recoverable depreciation)</label>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-out" aria-live="polite" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr))">
      <div class="out-big"><small>First check (ACV − deductible)</small><b data-o="first">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Held back until repairs</small><b data-o="held">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-big"><small>Total if fully recovered</small><b data-o="total">$0</b></div>
      <div class="out-rows" style="grid-column:1/-1">
        <div><span>Replacement cost (RCV)</span><b data-o="rcv">$0</b></div>
        <div><span>Total depreciation</span><b data-o="dep">$0</b></div>
