<h2>The method</h2>
<p>Each item is depreciated in a straight line, age divided by expected life, up to the cap you choose. Real estimates may use condition ratings, different lifespans or treat some items as non-depreciable, so use the result for planning.</p>
<h2>Life expectancies you’ll often see</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Typical range</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th>Laminated (architectural) shingles</th><td>25–30 years</td></tr><tr><th>Standing-seam metal roofing</th><td>40–60 years</td></tr><tr><th>Concrete tile roofing</th><td>40–50 years</td></tr><tr><th>Carpet and pad</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Interior paint</th><td>8–12 years</td></tr><tr><th>Furnace</th><td>15–20 years</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Collecting the holdback</h2>
<p>Policies typically release recoverable depreciation after repairs are complete, within a time limit. Send final invoices and photos. The <a href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">claim timeline planner</a> can remind you before that window closes.</p>
<h2>Questions about this calculator</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can labor be depreciated?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Practices differ by policy and jurisdiction. Ask your insurer to explain in writing how labor was treated in your estimate.</p></div></details><details><summary>What if I decide not to repair?<span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="ans"><p>Under many replacement cost policies, you keep the ACV payment but may not recover the depreciation that was held back.</p></div></details></div><h2>More free calculators</h2><div class="rel-grid"><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/roof-pitch-squares-estimator/"><small>Estimator</small><span>Roof Pitch &amp; Squares Estimator</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/percentage-deductible-calculator/"><small>Calculator</small><span>Percentage Deductible Calculator</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="rel" href="/utah-claim-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><small>Planner</small><span>Claim Timeline Planner</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div></article><aside class="aside"><div class="aside-in"><div class="side-box side-call"><h2 class="side-t">Talk it through, free</h2><p>Send the carrier’s estimate or call. We’ll tell you plainly whether appraisal is worth it.</p><a class="side-phone" href="tel:+18